.swarm/manifests/A2.1.files. I did NOT read .swarm/verdicts/A2.2.checker-second.verdict,
to keep this verdict independent.

Method note: because this repo has a recent ruling (2026-08-16a) about checkers reasoning
from source rather than behavior, the load-bearing conclusions below come from EXECUTED
mutation testing, not from reading. I copied the module (go.mod/go.sum/cmd/internal/web/
testdata) to a scratchpad tree outside the repo, injected seven single-point defects, and
ran the suite against each. The repo source was never modified: final `git status
--porcelain` shows only the six manifest paths plus .swarm bookkeeping.

