All three signatures byte-identical to the brief. Extra exported symbols (Path,
SaveWithWarnings, Validate, OverlapWarnings, Find, const AccountsFile) are additive and do
not alter a pinned signature; SaveWithWarnings is what lets `Save(...) error` still satisfy
